# Reference papers (do not upload to GitHub) — exception list for our own docs.
# Must be docs/* not docs/ : git will not descend into an excluded directory,
# so a !docs/<file> line under a bare `docs/` rule is inert. The older entries
# below only appeared to work because those files were already tracked.
docs/*
!docs/run_plan_2026-05-11.md
!docs/PLAN.md
!docs/methods.md
!docs/preregistration.md
!docs/judge_prompts.md
!docs/writing_style.md
*.tar.gz
.lambda_instance_id

# build products
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
